Homepage: https://github.com/aviralverma-8877/picamera
Description: Standalone WiFi-AP astrophotography camera controller
 Flask-based control app for a Raspberry Pi HQ Camera on a Pi Zero 2 W.
 Hosts its own open WiFi access point in the field, with captive-portal
 style onboarding, or joins a known network automatically at home.
 Manual exposure/ISO capture sequences, named/appendable sessions, a
 live focusing preview with digital zoom and center crosshair, raw DNG
 capture, and a gallery with per-image/session download and delete.
 .
 Assumes the standard Raspberry Pi OS "pi" user; installs the app under
 that user's home directory and runs it as that user.

